#: ../../about/citation.md:1 24b61fba185041b38a231956f20fc178
msgid "Citation"
msgstr "引用方法 (Citation)"

#: ../../about/citation.md:3 7a24e1d288da4010bc7105ea30c012c0
msgid ""
"If you use GWexpy in your research or publications, please cite it as "
"follows."
msgstr "GWexpy を研究や論文等で使用した場合は、以下の形式で引用していただけると幸いです。"

#: ../../about/citation.md:5 dd63652f8abf4d8097920a079cdfcd18
msgid "BibTeX Entry"
msgstr "論文での引用 (BibTeX)"

#: ../../about/citation.md:7 8b8e78577df5404e9156bceb9813125b
msgid ""
"For reproducibility of analysis results and continued maintenance of the "
"software, please use the following BibTeX entry."
msgstr "解析結果の再現性とソフトウェアの継続的なメンテナンスのために、以下の BibTeX エントリを使用してください。"

#: ../../about/citation.md:19 4ee7e32507044beb915cf5b580de101b
msgid ""
"The `version` field above is pinned to the release current at the time "
"this page was written; check the [Changelog](changelog.md) for the "
"version you actually used."
msgstr ""
"上記 BibTeX の `version` フィールドは、このページを書いた時点の最新リリースに固定されています。実際に使用したバージョンは "
"[Changelog](changelog.md) で確認してください。"

#: ../../about/citation.md:21 48a303bcca3f4943baf76c344e0a4231
msgid "CITATION.cff"
msgstr "CITATION.cff"

#: ../../about/citation.md:23 086d995e690e45789f42400e3dcb428a
msgid ""
"You can also retrieve citation information directly from GitHub using the"
" [**CITATION.cff**](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/CITATION.cff) file located in the root directory"
" of the repository."
msgstr ""
"リポジトリのルートディレクトリにある [**CITATION.cff**](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/CITATION.cff) ファイルを使用して、GitHub "
"上で直接引用情報を取得することもできます。"

#: ../../about/citation.md:27 a7625d428220472c8a5e9711ac420b63
msgid "Related Works"
msgstr "関連する先行研究"

#: ../../about/citation.md:29 f6d3847e3419465cbefda5c81fb0bfb1
msgid ""
"GWexpy is built upon the following software. We highly recommend citing "
"them as well:"
msgstr "GWexpy は以下のソフトウェアに基づいています。これらについても適切に引用することを推奨します。"

#: ../../about/citation.md:31 d3646a59fc3442928dc4349c875f313f
msgid "**GWpy**: `Duncan Macleod et al., gwpy/gwpy: ...`"
msgstr "**GWpy**: `Duncan Macleod et al., gwpy/gwpy: ...`"

#: ../../about/citation.md:32 33770f56cd6245658919c386e65957b2
msgid "**Astropy**: `Astropy Collaboration et al., ...`"
msgstr "**Astropy**: `Astropy Collaboration et al., ...`"

